43             model_id: Ollama model ID (e.g., "llama3", "mistral", "phi3").
44             options: Additional model parameters (e.g., top_k).
45             stop_sequences: List of sequences that will stop generation when encountered.
46             temperature: Controls randomness in generation (higher = more random).
47             top_p: Controls diversity via nucleus sampling (alternative to temperature).
48         """
49 
50         additional_args: dict[str, Any] | None
